neﬁt from using chatbots such as ChatGPT and Google Bard [ 3]. Their capacity to provide personalised education is one of their strongest points. This article addresses ChatGPT, an AI assistant chatbot [ 1], released by OpenAI [ 2], that has received signi ﬁcant public attention since its},
	journal = {Elsevier}
}


